  "details": "Images used as group icons, banners, post images, and event posters should persist even if the image is later deleted from a user’s inventory. The current behaviour of deleting an image from your inventory which would also delete the relevant group or event image that references it is really inconvenient especially if limited on gallery space. If a user wishes to remove an image related to a group or event they own then they would navigate to the relevant section of the group or event.",
